### 所有请求均通过网关 9001 端口转发
### 登录后将返回的 token 填入下方变量

@gateway = http://localhost:9001
@token = 请替换为登录后返回的token

### ==================== 用户服务 ====================

### 注册用户
POST {{gateway}}/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录（成功后复制返回的 token 填入上方 @token）
POST {{gateway}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录失败 - 密码错误
POST {{gateway}}/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "wrong_password"
}

### ==================== 医生服务 ====================

### 查询在线医生列表（需要 token）
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/search/online
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 更新医生费用（需要 token）
POST {{gateway}}/doctor/update/fee?doctorId=1&fee=200.00
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 无 token 访问（应返回 401）
GET {{gateway}}/doctor/search/online

### ==================== 订单服务 ====================

### 创建订单（需要 token）
POST {{gateway}}/order/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "order": {
    "id": 1001,
    "orderNo": "ORD20260318001",
    "userId": 1,
    "amount": 200.00,
    "status": 0
  },
  "orderItem": {
    "patientName": "张三",
    "patientIdCard": "110101199001011234",
    "patientPhone": "13900000001",
    "scheduleId": 1,
    "docId": 1,
    "docName": "李医生",
    "docTitle": "主任医师",
    "deptName": "内科",
    "workDate": "2026-03-20"
  }
}
